Modifications relative to gournal commit 6059064:

  * Compact-mode entry item parsing fixed (4-byte offsets when
    HEADER_INCOMPATIBLE_COMPACT is set, 16-byte otherwise).
  * EntryArray item walk uses the same compact/non-compact branching.
  * Microsecond-to-time.Time conversion bounds-checks against
    math.MaxInt64/1_000 to handle sentinel and far-future values safely.
  * LZ4 decompression upgraded from github.com/pierrec/lz4/v2 to
    github.com/pierrec/lz4/v4.
  * Nil-slice reads in the XZ and LZ4 decompression paths are handled.
  * EntryArray indexed traversal, compression detection, follow mode,
    and cursor checkpoint serialization are new in this package and not
    derived from gournal.

